  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e109a12f585ae684d8b04bd69c300cd0, type: 3}
  m_Name: L1Q2 Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuestDialogue
  quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 20cae48561d7de44ab62f2c62cabac6f, type: 2}
  before:
    lines:
    - Hm... by the looks of it, you must be Ruby.
    - A friend of mine told me you were coming to this island to help us deal with
      this whole robot mess we've got going on.
    - They've been malfunctioning lately. Badly. And they're all in desperate need
      of repair.
    - That's your job, far as I understand it.
    - Sure, they ain't gonna fix themselves.
    - You'll need to hit them with something first. Go on, try pressing C and look
      what happens.
    questToGrantAfter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 20cae48561d7de44ab62f2c62cabac6f,
      type: 2}
    onExhausted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  during:
    lines:
    - The robots ain't gonna fix themselves, you know.
    questToGrantAfter: {fileID: 0}
    onExhausted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  after:
    lines:
    - Good. Finally... maybe I can get some sleep around here.
    - Well... I think you're ready now.
    - Listen, here's the thing. Something's definitely going on with technology lately.
    - It's becoming agressive toward us for some reason...
    - Maybe it's grown tired of the way we've treated it... using it inappropriately...
    - It's hard to say. Truth is, we don't really know why this is happening.
    - I think you're the only one who's up for the task.
    - Find the source of this scourge and eliminate it.
    - We're counting on you!
    questToGrantAfter: {fileID: 0}
    onExhausted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 00de10106742a0a4a9d66f19712f2af1, type: 2}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: SceneLoader, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: LoadScene
          m_Mode: 5
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
